+ * \brief set the padding of the arrays of the material data manager, i.e.
+ * the number of unused values added to the leading dimension of the arrays
+ * of the states and of the tangent operator blocks (see
+ * `mgis::behaviour::MaterialDataManagerLayout`). The arrays bound to the
+ * initializer must account for the padding.
+ * \param[in,out] d: initializer
